t\t\t\t<p>Important News to Investors<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-66dcc8d\" data-id=\"66dcc8d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e3e4494 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e3e4494\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Refund of client cash and assets still held in dormant accounts with Arqaam Securities LLC<\/b><\/p>\n<p>The&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);\">Capital Market Authority (CMA)<\/span>&nbsp;has launched a new initiative to refund cash held in dormant accounts with brokerage firms, including those held with Arqaam Securities LLC. Investors who seek to reclaim their unclaimed funds must do so by submitting a \u2018pay-back\u2019 request to Arqaam Securities LLC, accompanied by necessary documents (such as ID or passport, bank details, account statements, and, if applicable, legal entity documentation or a power of attorney) as specified in the below announcement. Arqaam Securities LLC will then verify the claim and forward it to the&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);\">Capital Market Authority<\/span>, which aims to process and transfer the funds within 5 business days, provided all required information is submitted.<\/p>\n<p>Please see the following link announcement from the&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);\">Capital Market Authority<\/span>: <a href=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/SCA-launches-new-scheme-to-refund-cash-.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-462e0dc elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"462e0dc\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0882126\" data-id=\"0882126\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-466301b\" data-id=\"466301b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa47b2f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"aa47b2f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>ADX Markets Advisory on the Prohibition on Small Quality Trading<\/b><\/p><p>The ADX Markets has advised all securities brokers to kindly remind their clients that placing or executing trading orders in small quantities (or in some quantities less than their daily average trading quantities on the market) for a relevant security is deemed a violation of the ADX provisions and potentially may expose the investor to be held accountable in accordance with market rules and legislation.<\/p><p>Please see the following link announcement from the Abu Dhabi Securities Exchange: <a href=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/Circular-concerning-trading-small-quantities-and-low-values.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>ARQAAM SECURITIES, UAE Overview \/ Arqaam Securities, UAEStatusArqaam Group subsidiary | Arqaam Global Markets operating entityEntityArqaam Securities L.L.C. (incorporated in the United Arab Emirates)BusinessArqaam Securities UAE provides brokerage services for local shares and bonds on the UAE Markets and can act as a financial advisorRegulatory Arqaam Securities UAE is authorised and regulated by the UAE [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-full-width.php","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-15059","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Arqaam Securities, UAE - Arqaam<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.arqaamcapital.com\/arqaam-securities-uae\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Arqaam Securities, UAE - Arqaam\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"ARQAAM SECURITIES, UAE Overview \/ Arqaam Securities, UAEStatusArqaam Group subsidiary | Arqaam Global Markets operating entityEntityArqaam Securities L.L.C. (incorporated in 